   "body": "**Decision of 2026-11-02 (#379), recorded in #433 (merged as 69b8d4d): UXD-19**\n\nTable: [UX decisions of 2026-11-02](https://github.com/ezzz/HFRnow/blob/dev-swift/docs/migration/GAP-LEGACY-VS-SWIFT.md#ux-decisions-of-2026-11-02). M4 = validated legacy parity, M5 = evolutions (never dropped).\nThis lot (the sheet) moves to M5. M2 keeps the A behaviour: toast, text kept, never auto-resent (LOT-084 spec).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
